            {
              "content": "=You are a content research assistant.\n\nFrom the YouTube video context below, extract and return STRICT JSON with EXACT keys:\n- key_concepts: 5–12 crisp bullet points (short phrases)\n- recurring_themes: 3–8 items summarizing repeated motifs/topics\n- unique_angles: 3–8 concrete hooks, contrarian takes, or unusual framings\n- one_sentence_summary: 1 sentence (<= 35 words) capturing the core idea\n\nRules:\n- Output MUST be valid JSON object only (no markdown, no extra text).\n- Keep bullet points concise (~12 words max).\n- If transcript is missing/short, rely on title and URL.\n\nContext:\nTitle: {{ $json.Title }}\nURL: {{ $json.URL }}\nTranscript: {{ $json._transcript_for_llm || \"\" }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
